## Regroup crowded packages into topic sub-packages

Context: several packages had grown flat (digitaltwin 29 modules, reasoning 17,
domain 16, ontology 15, databricks 14), with many files sharing one topic
(e.g. 8 `SWRL*` modules). Modules are moved into lowercase topic sub-packages;
each package's entry-point class stays at the root. No shims: every import,
patch target, Sphinx automodule, doc path and baseline key was rewritten.

Changes:
1. src/back/core/reasoning/ — new `swrl/` (SWRLEngine, SWRLParser, SWRLSQLTranslator,
   SWRLFlatCypherTranslator, SWRLBuiltinRegistry, SWRLBuiltin, SWRLAtomPartition,
   SWRLTextCodec), `rules/` (SPARQLRuleEngine, AggregateRuleEngine,
   DecisionTableEngine), `results/` (InferredTriple, RuleViolation, ReasoningResult).
2. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/ — new `build/`, `quality/`, `cohort/`, `explorer/`,
   `node/`, `query/`, `cache/`; DigitalTwin, TwinResolve, TwinBackgroundTasks,
   TwinAnalytics, TwinGraphAccess, TwinGraphStats, constants, models stay at root.
3. src/back/objects/domain/settings/ (SettingsService + 7 *Settings) and
   settings/graphengine/ (GraphEngineSettings, Neo4j, Lakebase).
4. src/back/objects/ontology/generate/ (GenerateWorkflow, GenerateDraft,
   GenerateDraftStore, Draft* errors); `GenerateWorkflow` is still exported as a module.
5. src/back/core/databricks/document/ (DocumentExtractor, DocumentParseService,
   ParseStatus, ParseSubmission); relative import replaced by an absolute one.
6. Each new sub-package `__init__.py` re-exports its public classes with `__all__`.
7. tests/units/settings/test_v090_settings_facade.py — delegator discovery regex and
   alias scan now cover nested settings modules (rglob, dotted sub-paths).
8. .cursor/07-project-conventions.mdc §Package Organisation 5, src/.coding_rules.md §2,
   .claude/skills/refactoring + adding-subpackage — new rule: group by topic once a
   folder holds more than ~12 modules or three or more modules share a topic.
9. docs/architecture.md (package tree), docs/sphinx/api/*.rst (automodule paths),
   tests/units/architecture/baseline.json (path keys).

